hinese hacking campaign hit a 9th US telecom"}]}, {"kind": "info", "id": "gap", "eyebrow": "The gap", "title": "Voluntary security was not enough", "body": "Telecom security had largely been voluntary. Officials called that inadequate and pushed for required practices.", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/chinese-hacking-campaign-hit-a-9th-u-s-telecom-firm-white-house-says", "label": "PBS NewsHour, Chinese hacking campaign hit a 9th US telecom"}]}, {"kind": "multipleChoice", "id": "mc", "prompt": "What did the Salt Typhoon hackers mainly want from the telecoms?", "options": ["A large ransom paid in cryptocurrency", "Call records and targets' messages", "To shut down the national phone network"], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "This was espionage: who calls whom, plus the calls and texts of government targets."}, {"kind": "theCall", "id": "call", "situation": "You run security at a regional phone carrier. Officials have just published guidance on hunting these intruders.", "prompt": "What do you do first?", "options": ["Wait to see if your company is named", "Hunt for the intruders using the guidance", "Announce that your network is safe"], "consequences": ["Nine carriers were hit; waiting gives intruders more time.", "The guidance exists so carriers can find them now.", "Claiming safety before checking can backfire badly."], "correctIndex": 1, "explanation": "Assume you could be a target and look. The guidance was published for exactly that."}, {"id": "lens-invest", "kind": "info", "title": "New rules mean new spending", "body": "Officials pushed telecoms from voluntary to required security. Mandates like that create budgets for security vendors.", "eyebrow": "For investors", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/chinese-hacking-campaign-hit-a-9th-u-s-telecom-firm-white-house-says", "label": "PBS NewsHour, Chinese hacking campaign hit a 9th US telecom"}]}, {"id": "rule", "kind": "microInsight", "text": "In cyber, the most valuable target is often the network everyone else depends on.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/chinese-hacking-campaign-hit-a-9th-u-s-telecom-firm-white-house-says", "label": "PBS NewsHour, Chinese hacking campaign hit a 9th US telecom"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "Salt Typhoon breached nine US telecoms by December 2024, taking call records and some officials' communications. Officials called voluntary telecom security inadequate.", "sectionKey": "review"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
