he most valuable target is often the network everyone else depends on.", "eyebrow": "The rule", "sources": [{"url": "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/chinese-hacking-campaign-hit-a-9th-u-s-telecom-firm-white-house-says", "label": "PBS NewsHour, Chinese hacking campaign hit a 9th US telecom"}]}, {"id": "say-it", "kind": "sayIt", "takeaway": "Salt Typhoon breached nine US telecoms by December 2024, taking call records and some officials' communications. Officials called voluntary telecom security inadequate.", "sectionKey": "first_test"}]}$ml$::jsonb),
