($ml$3ddb2484-e618-5c54-9536-ff3fd119e1b2$ml$::uuid, $ml$4f52ed42-859d-50a9-9fb4-cda9fc16f76e$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 6 · Where it breaks$ml$, $ml$By December 2024, US officials said China-linked hackers had breached nine US telecom companies. The campaign, called Salt Typhoon, took customer call records and reached the private communications of a limited number of people, believed to include senior US officials. The White House said voluntary security practices were inadequate against China, and the FCC was set to take up required rules for telecom companies.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/chinese-hacking-campaign-hit-a-9th-u-s-telecom-firm-white-house-says", "label": "PBS NewsHour, Chinese hacking campaign hit a 9th US telecom"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$122cb211-7208-566e-91d3-d9d6aa21c402$ml$::uuid, $ml$4f52ed42-859d-50a9-9fb4-cda9fc16f76e$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The target$ml$, $ml$The goal was to know who calls whom, then listen to chosen targets. The FBI said most targets were involved in government or politics.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/chinese-hacking-campaign-hit-a-9th-u-s-telecom-firm-white-house-says", "label": "PBS NewsHour, Chinese hacking campaign hit a 9th US telecom"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$c781124d-29d8-59c3-a756-e68586114cb7$ml$::uuid, $ml$4f52ed42-859d-50a9-9fb4-cda9fc16f76e$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The scale$ml$, $ml$At least eight US telecoms were named first, then a ninth. Officials said dozens of countries were affected.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/chinese-hacking-campaign-hit-a-9th-u-s-telecom-firm-white-house-says", "label": "PBS NewsHour, Chinese hacking campaign hit a 9th US telecom"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$3d987e8c-9ee9-5aae-82af-53b6ddb5cfa0$ml$::uuid, $ml$4f52ed42-859d-50a9-9fb4-cda9fc16f76e$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Voluntary security was not enough$ml$, $ml$Telecom security had largely been voluntary. Officials called that inadequate and pushed for required practices.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/chinese-hacking-campaign-hit-a-9th-u-s-telecom-firm-white-house-says", "label": "PBS NewsHour, Chinese hacking campaign hit a 9th US telecom"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$7299eb16-40d8-5292-8f95-68fbd01309c3$ml$::uuid, $ml$4f52ed42-859d-50a9-9fb4-cda9fc16f76e$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Carriers need to hunt$ml$, $ml$Officials told carriers to hunt for intruders in their own networks. Tools that make that hunt easier have buyers.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/chinese-hacking-campaign-hit-a-9th-u-s-telecom-firm-white-house-says", "label": "PBS NewsHour, Chinese hacking campaign hit a 9th US telecom"}]$ml$::jsonb),
