($ml$56e69d4e-9ed7-5e16-a08e-4c44cea33db4$ml$::uuid, $ml$731252d6-1ced-5aae-946c-95671e341521$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Defenders cannot patch everything at once$ml$, $ml$At about 108 new flaws a day, teams rank them by how likely and how damaging an attack would be. The average severity score in 2024 was 6.67 out of 10.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://jerrygamblin.com/2025/01/05/2024-cve-data-review/", "label": "Jerry Gamblin, 2024 CVE data review"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$f64102dd-e574-5310-b99b-f8b3256076e2$ml$::uuid, $ml$731252d6-1ced-5aae-946c-95671e341521$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$108 new flaws a day$ml$, $ml$In 2024, a new publicly numbered software flaw appeared roughly every 13 minutes.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://jerrygamblin.com/2025/01/05/2024-cve-data-review/", "label": "Jerry Gamblin, 2024 CVE data review"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$11906923-68fa-5627-883d-9b9478cbbd4e$ml$::uuid, $ml$731252d6-1ced-5aae-946c-95671e341521$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In cyber, the flaw matters less than whether someone can and will exploit it.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/time-to-exploit-trends-2023?hl=en", "label": "Google Cloud (Mandiant), time-to-exploit trends 2023"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$760e847e-5b06-5fcf-83cb-aa38e57d1ef2$ml$::uuid, $ml$44559286-526c-5ff1-840d-95c839cdabb1$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 8 · The money$ml$, $ml$In 2024, Google paid $11.8 million to 660 security researchers who found flaws in its products. This is a bug bounty: outside researchers report flaws privately and get paid instead of selling or publishing them. Google's top single reward that year was $110,000, and its programs have paid $65 million since 2010. Chrome alone paid $3.4 million to 137 researchers.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.techradar.com/pro/security/google-bug-bounty-payments-hit-nearly-usd12-million-in-2024", "label": "TechRadar, Google bug bounty payments in 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$15c28f76-86c1-57d4-9064-06345b35194b$ml$::uuid, $ml$44559286-526c-5ff1-840d-95c839cdabb1$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The deal$ml$, $ml$Researchers report flaws privately; the company fixes them, then pays. It turns potential attackers into paid testers.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.techradar.com/pro/security/google-bug-bounty-payments-hit-nearly-usd12-million-in-2024", "label": "TechRadar, Google bug bounty payments in 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$8d2dd2d3-118d-5ebe-894f-c131266cf4ee$ml$::uuid, $ml$44559286-526c-5ff1-840d-95c839cdabb1$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The math$ml$, $ml$For a company Google's size, $11.8 million a year is cheap insurance. The average US breach cost $10.22 million in 2025.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.techradar.com/pro/security/google-bug-bounty-payments-hit-nearly-usd12-million-in-2024", "label": "TechRadar, Google bug bounty payments in 2024"}, {"url": "https://cyberscoop.com/ibm-cost-data-breach-2025/", "label": "CyberScoop on IBM Cost of a Data Breach 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$d4c2f659-f70e-58f7-956e-538902320b68$ml$::uuid, $ml$44559286-526c-5ff1-840d-95c839cdabb1$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Bounties are now routine$ml$, $ml$Google has run reward programs since 2010 and paid $65 million in total. Its biggest single 2024 reward was $110,000.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.techradar.com/pro/security/google-bug-bounty-payments-hit-nearly-usd12-million-in-2024", "label": "TechRadar, Google bug bounty payments in 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$f9bc1b42-290e-58eb-8961-85a1f6b93850$ml$::uuid, $ml$44559286-526c-5ff1-840d-95c839cdabb1$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Bounties build a track record$ml$, $ml$Many security careers start with bug bounty finds. A credited report is proof of skill you can show.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.techradar.com/pro/security/google-bug-bounty-payments-hit-nearly-usd12-million-in-2024", "label": "TechRadar, Google bug bounty payments in 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$b8487096-e323-520f-815c-afda147c6537$ml$::uuid, $ml$44559286-526c-5ff1-840d-95c839cdabb1$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In cyber, paying someone to find a flaw is cheaper than paying for the breach.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.techradar.com/pro/security/google-bug-bounty-payments-hit-nearly-usd12-million-in-2024", "label": "TechRadar, Google bug bounty payments in 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
