($ml$9458b7ce-c51a-5879-a2e6-66b6edb83690$ml$::uuid, $ml$325caea1-03dc-5cbc-960f-34b32391629b$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 8 · The money$ml$, $ml$In 2024, Google paid $11.8 million to 660 security researchers who found flaws in its products. This is a bug bounty: outside researchers report flaws privately and get paid instead of selling or publishing them. Google's top single reward that year was $110,000, and its programs have paid $65 million since 2010. Chrome alone paid $3.4 million to 137 researchers.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.techradar.com/pro/security/google-bug-bounty-payments-hit-nearly-usd12-million-in-2024", "label": "TechRadar, Google bug bounty payments in 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$b3ced0e8-e8c4-525e-9f75-1374f8074cc7$ml$::uuid, $ml$325caea1-03dc-5cbc-960f-34b32391629b$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The deal$ml$, $ml$Researchers report flaws privately; the company fixes them, then pays. It turns potential attackers into paid testers.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.techradar.com/pro/security/google-bug-bounty-payments-hit-nearly-usd12-million-in-2024", "label": "TechRadar, Google bug bounty payments in 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$bde54bb8-a195-5f82-ae29-1a8f10836668$ml$::uuid, $ml$325caea1-03dc-5cbc-960f-34b32391629b$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The math$ml$, $ml$For a company Google's size, $11.8 million a year is cheap insurance. The average US breach cost $10.22 million in 2025.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.techradar.com/pro/security/google-bug-bounty-payments-hit-nearly-usd12-million-in-2024", "label": "TechRadar, Google bug bounty payments in 2024"}, {"url": "https://cyberscoop.com/ibm-cost-data-breach-2025/", "label": "CyberScoop on IBM Cost of a Data Breach 2025"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$e1bf2ddb-8d04-55c9-9c08-79ad639c9278$ml$::uuid, $ml$325caea1-03dc-5cbc-960f-34b32391629b$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Bounties are now routine$ml$, $ml$Google has run reward programs since 2010 and paid $65 million in total. Its biggest single 2024 reward was $110,000.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.techradar.com/pro/security/google-bug-bounty-payments-hit-nearly-usd12-million-in-2024", "label": "TechRadar, Google bug bounty payments in 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$d7898be9-c9f0-55a4-910c-97b45255812b$ml$::uuid, $ml$325caea1-03dc-5cbc-960f-34b32391629b$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Run a bounty early$ml$, $ml$A small, well-run bounty program lets outsiders find your flaws before attackers do.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.techradar.com/pro/security/google-bug-bounty-payments-hit-nearly-usd12-million-in-2024", "label": "TechRadar, Google bug bounty payments in 2024"}]$ml$::jsonb),
