($ml$77f9b228-b6e4-5fbe-baa2-355b732fae78$ml$::uuid, $ml$3ce44cc7-bf2a-5c22-8680-f787f3640045$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The method$ml$, $ml$The attacker spent years earning trust as a contributor. Then used that trust to ship the backdoor.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.elastic.co/cn/security-labs/500ms-to-midnight", "label": "Elastic Security Labs, the xz backdoor"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$b5816fd4-8ee9-5577-a8b2-c5bb416ca267$ml$::uuid, $ml$3ce44cc7-bf2a-5c22-8680-f787f3640045$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The save$ml$, $ml$It was caught by curiosity, not by a security tool. One engineer wondered why logins were half a second slow.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.elastic.co/cn/security-labs/500ms-to-midnight", "label": "Elastic Security Labs, the xz backdoor"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$7ead8c30-0051-55e0-9661-c06954031eed$ml$::uuid, $ml$3ce44cc7-bf2a-5c22-8680-f787f3640045$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Who checks the maintainers?$ml$, $ml$Key open-source tools often depend on a handful of volunteers. Few safeguards check who earns commit rights. It was tracked as CVE-2024-3094.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.elastic.co/cn/security-labs/500ms-to-midnight", "label": "Elastic Security Labs, the xz backdoor"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$3cc50dcf-9117-53a4-a541-9f5242911c0d$ml$::uuid, $ml$3ce44cc7-bf2a-5c22-8680-f787f3640045$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Saved by half a second$ml$, $ml$A backdoor that took years to plant was found because SSH logins got 500 milliseconds slower.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.elastic.co/cn/security-labs/500ms-to-midnight", "label": "Elastic Security Labs, the xz backdoor"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$72034872-1079-515f-b0e4-889ca35a4b61$ml$::uuid, $ml$3ce44cc7-bf2a-5c22-8680-f787f3640045$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In cyber, trusted people can be the attack path, not just flawed code.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.elastic.co/cn/security-labs/500ms-to-midnight", "label": "Elastic Security Labs, the xz backdoor"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$c6ae646a-c1f5-51d3-a709-c8e82a921155$ml$::uuid, $ml$19f2b6f7-cc27-598e-bfad-c0e2a316d680$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 13 · Frameworks$ml$, $ml$NIST CSF is a voluntary guide, ISO 27001 is a certificate, and SOC 2 is an auditor's report. NIST released version 2.0 of its Cybersecurity Framework in February 2024 for all organizations, adding a Govern function to its five others. ISO/IEC 27001 sets requirements for an information security management system, and companies can choose to be certified against it. A SOC 2 is an audit by a CPA under criteria from the AICPA.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.huntonprivacyblog.com/2024/03/04/nist-releases-cybersecurity-framework-2-0/", "label": "Hunton, NIST releases Cybersecurity Framework 2.0"}, {"url": "https://webcf.waybackmachine.org/web/20230531192221/https://www.iso.org/isoiec-27001-information-security.html", "label": "ISO, ISO/IEC 27001 information security management"}, {"url": "https://cpl.thalesgroup.com/insights/cybersecurity/what-is-soc-2-compliance", "label": "Thales, what is SOC 2 compliance"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$57dbe782-77c9-52bd-a01a-7f2dbc237f47$ml$::uuid, $ml$19f2b6f7-cc27-598e-bfad-c0e2a316d680$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$NIST CSF 2.0$ml$, $ml$Six functions: Govern, Identify, Protect, Detect, Respond and Recover. Govern, new in 2024, covers how leaders make security decisions.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.huntonprivacyblog.com/2024/03/04/nist-releases-cybersecurity-framework-2-0/", "label": "Hunton, NIST releases Cybersecurity Framework 2.0"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$849a3e84-e514-52e9-a2b8-77ac27d63581$ml$::uuid, $ml$19f2b6f7-cc27-598e-bfad-c0e2a316d680$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$ISO/IEC 27001$ml$, $ml$ISO 27001 is the best-known standard for running information security as a managed system. Its current edition was published in October 2022.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://webcf.waybackmachine.org/web/20230531192221/https://www.iso.org/isoiec-27001-information-security.html", "label": "ISO, ISO/IEC 27001 information security management"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$5002345f-cbc5-5bdb-a238-134a5bc5a872$ml$::uuid, $ml$19f2b6f7-cc27-598e-bfad-c0e2a316d680$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$SOC 2 is an audit report$ml$, $ml$A CPA tests a company against up to five criteria. Security is always included; the other four are optional. Type I checks the design; Type II tests how controls work over time.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://cpl.thalesgroup.com/insights/cybersecurity/what-is-soc-2-compliance", "label": "Thales, what is SOC 2 compliance"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$2397a612-dc1a-5800-bba0-e99c928d73e7$ml$::uuid, $ml$19f2b6f7-cc27-598e-bfad-c0e2a316d680$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Name the right framework$ml$, $ml$Say NIST CSF for strategy, ISO 27001 for certification, SOC 2 for customer audits. Mixing them up is a common miss.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.huntonprivacyblog.com/2024/03/04/nist-releases-cybersecurity-framework-2-0/", "label": "Hunton, NIST releases Cybersecurity Framework 2.0"}, {"url": "https://webcf.waybackmachine.org/web/20230531192221/https://www.iso.org/isoiec-27001-information-security.html", "label": "ISO, ISO/IEC 27001 information security management"}, {"url": "https://cpl.thalesgroup.com/insights/cybersecurity/what-is-soc-2-compliance", "label": "Thales, what is SOC 2 compliance"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$6228dcab-a989-59ec-ba22-adeac82dc07c$ml$::uuid, $ml$19f2b6f7-cc27-598e-bfad-c0e2a316d680$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In security, a framework is how you prove to others that you are in control.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.huntonprivacyblog.com/2024/03/04/nist-releases-cybersecurity-framework-2-0/", "label": "Hunton, NIST releases Cybersecurity Framework 2.0"}, {"url": "https://cpl.thalesgroup.com/insights/cybersecurity/what-is-soc-2-compliance", "label": "Thales, what is SOC 2 compliance"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$f37123f8-6856-5010-940b-483bb390fd20$ml$::uuid, $ml$cd5c1ac7-a3a9-505d-bbe4-95dd096e10f3$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 13 · Frameworks$ml$, $ml$NIST CSF is a voluntary guide, ISO 27001 is a certificate, and SOC 2 is an auditor's report. NIST released version 2.0 of its Cybersecurity Framework in February 2024 for all organizations, adding a Govern function to its five others. ISO/IEC 27001 sets requirements for an information security management system, and companies can choose to be certified against it. A SOC 2 is an audit by a CPA under criteria from the AICPA.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.huntonprivacyblog.com/2024/03/04/nist-releases-cybersecurity-framework-2-0/", "label": "Hunton, NIST releases Cybersecurity Framework 2.0"}, {"url": "https://webcf.waybackmachine.org/web/20230531192221/https://www.iso.org/isoiec-27001-information-security.html", "label": "ISO, ISO/IEC 27001 information security management"}, {"url": "https://cpl.thalesgroup.com/insights/cybersecurity/what-is-soc-2-compliance", "label": "Thales, what is SOC 2 compliance"}]$ml$::jsonb),
