($ml$cfe542ef-d6c4-5803-ae1b-c93c9faef33e$ml$::uuid, $ml$d109a838-3236-5193-9aae-461c277ab114$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$Even after a leak$ml$, $ml$A leaked password alone was usually not enough with MFA on. Risk fell by 98.56% for those accounts.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.00945", "label": "Microsoft researchers, how effective is MFA"}]$ml$::jsonb),
