($ml$117744df-227f-5ed7-a778-a83903eb5734$ml$::uuid, $ml$4013a8eb-b91f-5eae-a2f3-f7edd1b07a79$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The old model$ml$, $ml$Perimeter security trusts anyone already inside the wall. One stolen login could open the whole network.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://csrc.nist.gov/Pubs/sp/800/207/Final", "label": "NIST SP 800-207, Zero Trust Architecture"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$1829df6d-add9-5f7c-a4fe-d0cb78bb9698$ml$::uuid, $ml$4013a8eb-b91f-5eae-a2f3-f7edd1b07a79$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The new model$ml$, $ml$Zero trust checks the user and the device before every session. Location alone earns nothing.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://csrc.nist.gov/Pubs/sp/800/207/Final", "label": "NIST SP 800-207, Zero Trust Architecture"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$b671b545-4065-5897-968d-2e7891f00d9f$ml$::uuid, $ml$4013a8eb-b91f-5eae-a2f3-f7edd1b07a79$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$The US government adopted it$ml$, $ml$A 2022 White House memo set zero trust goals for federal agencies to meet by the end of fiscal 2024.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/M-22-09.pdf", "label": "OMB memo M-22-09, federal zero trust strategy"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$cd5f9c66-2ccc-5fb9-a09b-7c5e9ee17f20$ml$::uuid, $ml$4013a8eb-b91f-5eae-a2f3-f7edd1b07a79$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$No more castle walls$ml$, $ml$Zero trust treats every access like a stranger at the door, even from inside the office.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://csrc.nist.gov/Pubs/sp/800/207/Final", "label": "NIST SP 800-207, Zero Trust Architecture"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$8fe99d0c-6105-5394-9349-4f0054d52a48$ml$::uuid, $ml$4013a8eb-b91f-5eae-a2f3-f7edd1b07a79$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In network security, location is not identity.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://csrc.nist.gov/Pubs/sp/800/207/Final", "label": "NIST SP 800-207, Zero Trust Architecture"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$88d659a1-dbe5-5a06-a583-14845d70cb43$ml$::uuid, $ml$0ea792a9-0858-5491-9b04-46f52b455dfa$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 26 · The money$ml$, $ml$Zscaler, a cloud zero trust vendor, earned $2.67 billion in fiscal 2025, up 23%. Instead of boxes in a company's server room, Zscaler routes users' traffic through its cloud, checking each connection. Customers pay by subscription. Its CEO said annual recurring revenue topped $3 billion, and it guided to about $3.7 billion in revenue for fiscal 2026.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.constellationr.com/insights/news/zscaler-delivers-strong-q4-fiscal-2026-outlook", "label": "Constellation Research, Zscaler fiscal 2025 results"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$150d94af-8da2-56c7-8f7b-6f812238b153$ml$::uuid, $ml$0ea792a9-0858-5491-9b04-46f52b455dfa$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$The model$ml$, $ml$Customers rent security as a service instead of buying hardware. That turns one-off sales into recurring revenue.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.constellationr.com/insights/news/zscaler-delivers-strong-q4-fiscal-2026-outlook", "label": "Constellation Research, Zscaler fiscal 2025 results"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$a3b55980-76fb-5c23-b07b-c801efe4717e$ml$::uuid, $ml$0ea792a9-0858-5491-9b04-46f52b455dfa$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The growth$ml$, $ml$Revenue grew 23% in fiscal 2025. The 2026 guidance was $3.68 to $3.7 billion.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.constellationr.com/insights/news/zscaler-delivers-strong-q4-fiscal-2026-outlook", "label": "Constellation Research, Zscaler fiscal 2025 results"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$8508212b-656c-529c-8260-88545ddb4c80$ml$::uuid, $ml$0ea792a9-0858-5491-9b04-46f52b455dfa$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Remote work broke the perimeter$ml$, $ml$When staff work from anywhere, checking each connection in the cloud fits better than a wall around one office.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.constellationr.com/insights/news/zscaler-delivers-strong-q4-fiscal-2026-outlook", "label": "Constellation Research, Zscaler fiscal 2025 results"}, {"url": "https://csrc.nist.gov/Pubs/sp/800/207/Final", "label": "NIST SP 800-207, Zero Trust Architecture"}]$ml$::jsonb),
