($ml$10012a2d-4b8c-544c-99c1-daa2f97c2377$ml$::uuid, $ml$d0f76899-e791-55c8-8145-e59fa8d081ec$ml$::uuid, 6, $ml$The rule$ml$, $ml$In security, recurring revenue rewards vendors who stay useful every month.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://www.constellationr.com/insights/news/zscaler-delivers-strong-q4-fiscal-2026-outlook", "label": "Constellation Research, Zscaler fiscal 2025 results"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$3073545e-86e0-5a29-ab40-3b41c2abd755$ml$::uuid, $ml$25932555-93eb-558a-987b-a968b6b9c2b9$ml$::uuid, 1, $ml$Day 27 · The power$ml$, $ml$In February 2024, CISA ordered US civilian agencies to disconnect Ivanti VPN products within 48 hours. Attackers, including suspected Chinese state-backed hackers, were exploiting several zero-day flaws in Ivanti Connect Secure and had bypassed published fixes. One research firm counted at least 2,200 compromised devices. Agencies usually get weeks to patch; this deadline was unusually short.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2024/02/01/cisa-federal-agencies-disconnect-ivanti-vpn", "label": "TechCrunch, CISA orders agencies to disconnect Ivanti VPNs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$ff07c6b6-f46f-5c5e-b1ed-328737467f45$ml$::uuid, $ml$25932555-93eb-558a-987b-a968b6b9c2b9$ml$::uuid, 2, $ml$Why edge devices$ml$, $ml$VPNs and firewalls sit at the edge, facing the whole internet. Break one, and you are inside.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2024/02/01/cisa-federal-agencies-disconnect-ivanti-vpn", "label": "TechCrunch, CISA orders agencies to disconnect Ivanti VPNs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$e4a94eea-33b5-51b5-8d45-80c7e9147491$ml$::uuid, $ml$25932555-93eb-558a-987b-a968b6b9c2b9$ml$::uuid, 3, $ml$The cleanup$ml$, $ml$Reconnecting effectively required a fresh, patched install. Ivanti advised factory resets so attackers could not hang on.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2024/02/01/cisa-federal-agencies-disconnect-ivanti-vpn", "label": "TechCrunch, CISA orders agencies to disconnect Ivanti VPNs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$cec4afb2-43f4-57e0-8063-86c0b2df3164$ml$::uuid, $ml$25932555-93eb-558a-987b-a968b6b9c2b9$ml$::uuid, 4, $ml$Assume they got further$ml$, $ml$Agencies also had to hunt for threats on connected systems and audit privileged accounts.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2024/02/01/cisa-federal-agencies-disconnect-ivanti-vpn", "label": "TechCrunch, CISA orders agencies to disconnect Ivanti VPNs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
($ml$b4b440eb-1de3-5d26-be6d-932b9df1581c$ml$::uuid, $ml$25932555-93eb-558a-987b-a968b6b9c2b9$ml$::uuid, 5, $ml$Edge devices are hot targets$ml$, $ml$VPNs and firewalls are where attackers aim first. Knowing how to respond to an edge flaw is a core skill.$ml$, $ml$[{"url": "https://techcrunch.com/2024/02/01/cisa-federal-agencies-disconnect-ivanti-vpn", "label": "TechCrunch, CISA orders agencies to disconnect Ivanti VPNs"}]$ml$::jsonb),
